          "english_quote": "“You tell me first—for otherwise you cannot see him.”",
          "issue": "The terminal printed dash is absent, and the notes do not disclose it. The draft consequently normalizes the visibly unfinished prompt. The supplied transcription establishes the printed marker, but its function should not be silently classified as either interrupted speech or an editorial omission.",
          "suggested_revision": "Retain the terminal dash, for example: “You tell me first (for otherwise you cannot see him)—.” Add a note quoting the supplied Greek and explaining that the edition leaves this marker after the prompt; no completion has been supplied. Preserve uncertainty about its function rather than inventing an object for “tell me.”",
